---
title: "Statechart runtime selection"
---
stateDiagram-v2
  s0: Start
  s1: Check local configuration
  s2: Ready
  s3: Check installed tools
  s4: Configuration or install error
  s5: Install pinned tools
  [*] --> s0
  s0 --> s1: no explicit TLC path
  s0 --> s2: use explicit environment paths
  s1 --> s3: no local configuration
  s1 --> s4: reject invalid configuration
  s1 --> s2: use configured paths [valid configuration]
  s3 --> s5: tools unavailable
  s3 --> s2: use installed tools
  s5 --> s4: installation fails
  s5 --> s2: installation succeeds
